'''Extinction's Vortex (Merciless)''' is the second stage in [[Typhoon Nihil]]. Upon completion, players are guaranteed to unlock the [[True Form]] of [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Primordial Cat]], Future Cat. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

